      "text": "main Entities \n\norder {product-id,amount}\noperator {username,email,refreshtoken,password-hash}\nuser{user-id, role: \"customer\" | \"operator\"}\nTask \ninventory {product-id,amount,producer,sku} \nrobot \nCustomer \nproduct\npayment\n",
